# --- board/actions/ and board/optimize/ (Tasks 9-10, 10b) ---------------------------------------
# `DrillItemMover`'s and `TraceShover`'s **check** halves landed in Task 9, `ForcedPadRouter`'s and
# `ForcedViaInserter`'s in Task 10. The mutating halves split two ways, per **controller ruling AA**:
# `ForcedViaInserter.insert`, `ForcedPadRouter.forcedPad`, `TraceShover.insert` and
# `DrillItemMover.{insert,shoveVias}` are one chain Plan 6 needs (Task 15 reaches it at
# `FoundConnectionInserter.java:754`), and **Task 10b ported all five**.
# `TraceShover.springOverObstacles` followed in **Task 15b** under controller ruling AB, because
# `RoutingBoard.insertForcedTracePolyline:522-524` calls it on every polyline it inserts, so
# `TraceShover`'s deferral roster is now **empty**.
ForcedViaInserter                 board_ext/forced_via_inserter.rs
ForcedPadRouter                   board_ext/forced_pad_router.rs
DrillItemMover                    board_ext/drill_item_mover.rs
TraceShover                       board_ext/trace_shover.rs
# The pull-tight family (Task 15a, **controller ruling AB**). Ruling 2 had put all of
# `board/optimize`'s mutating half in Plan 7; Task 15 found that Java's trace insertion
# pull-tightens every polyline unconditionally, so ruling AB moved these four classes — and
# `PolylineTrace.pullTight`, whose Rust home is `board_ext/tightener/mod.rs` because its argument
# is a `TraceTightener` — into Plan 6. `ViaOptimizer` stays Plan 7's, and so do `optChangedArea`'s
# batch callers and `removeItemsAndPullTight`. **Plan 7 Task 5** then landed
# `TraceTightener.optChangedArea` itself (and `PolylineTrace`'s `check`/`correct`/`swapConnectionToPin`,
# which live in the same file for the same reason `pullTight` does), so `board/optimize`'s marker
# for it is gone. **Plan 7 Task 6** then landed `ViaOptimizer`'s entry half and re-pointed its row
# (plan ruling 13), and **Plan 7 Task 7** landed the three `repositionVia` overloads in the same
# file, so `ViaOptimizer.java` is ported whole and carries no forward marker.
TraceTightener                    board_ext/tightener/mod.rs
TraceTightener                    board_ext/tightener/base.rs
TraceTightener90                  board_ext/tightener/tightener_90.rs
TraceTightener45                  board_ext/tightener/tightener_45.rs
TraceTightenerAnyAngle            board_ext/tightener/tightener_any_angle.rs

